{"id":"poignet","lemma":"poignet","pos":"noun","rank":3398,"glosses":["wrist","carpus"],"ipa":"/pwa.ɲɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/70/Fr-poignet.ogg/Fr-poignet.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"poignets"},"formAudio":{"poignets":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-poignets.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon poignet me fait mal.","en":"My wrist hurts.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"harm, pain, evil"}]},{"text":"Je me suis cassé le poignet.","en":"I have a broken wrist.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"broken"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"L'homme attrapa la fille par le poignet.","en":"The man caught the girl by the wrist.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"to trap","l":"attraper"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"girl"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Les poignets de la veste de son complet sont très usés.","en":"The cuffs of his suit jacket are badly frayed.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,null,null,{"g":"jacket"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"full"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"worn-out, deteriorated","l":"usé"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Je me suis fait une entorse au poignet.","en":"I sprained my wrist.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"sprain"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}